OL,3,AFireworks and fancy dress for Derry's
OL,4,A40th Halloween celebrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow a major fixture in the city's
OL,7,Fcalendar, the final day of the festival
OL,8,Fattracted visitors from around the
OL,9,Fworld, who joined in the celebrations
OL,10,Fwith all of the ghosts, ghouls and
OL,11,Fgoblins.
